    <h2>🧩 The Problem &amp; Our Solution</h2>

    <h3>The Problem</h3>
    <p>Job hunting today is broken in a very specific way: <strong>silence</strong>. You apply to dozens of roles, sometimes hundreds, and most companies never respond at all. You're left:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Manually maintaining a spreadsheet (or worse, sticky notes) to track every application</li>
      <li>Constantly wondering "did they see my application?" or "should I follow up?"</li>
      <li>Forgetting to follow up until it's too late, or following up too aggressively</li>
      <li>Losing motivation as the uncertainty piles up across dozens of open applications</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Our Solution</h3>
    <p>doneche replaces manual tracking + guesswork with an automated system built specifically for the "silence" problem:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Automatic Ghost Detection</strong> — no more wondering; after 7 days of silence, doneche tells you.</li>
      <li><strong>One-click Follow-ups</strong> — a ready-made, professional follow-up email template for every ghosted application.</li>
      <li><strong>Magic Upload</strong> — skip manual data entry entirely; just upload a screenshot or forward an email.</li>
      <li><strong>Visual Kanban Board</strong> — see your entire job search pipeline at a glance.</li>
      <li><strong>Curated Job Matching</strong> — get matched to real openings based on your actual skills and resume.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>The result: less anxiety, less manual admin, more momentum. <a href="/register">Try doneche free</a>.</p>
